# Divine Interference's Progress and Event replies against the rival containers at the same NPCs (task 5 review
# Important 1; see waking_the_colossus#rivals). main (Naja Salaheem, 932 with the Whisper, a full bag so the quest
# stays accepted): Promotion: Private First Class accepted answers 5001 (an Event): 932 twice, the second talk not
# rotating to 5001. bob (Imperial Whitegate, available: Waking the Colossus completed, ToAU 48, Prog 1, Timer 0: 931)
# and carl (Divine Interference completed with the Timer 0: 931): Trust: Nashmeira's 5092 (a Progress): the tie, the
# quest's first. dan (blank_lamp, Prog 2 with the Lightning Cell: 308) against Nashmeira's Plea (ToAU 44, status 0: 8,
# an earlier Progress): 8 first, then 308 rotated.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Imperial_Whitegate/onTrigger AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/blank_lamp/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char bob zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=155.796,-4.199,0.03 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char carl zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=155.796,-4.199,0.03 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char dan zone=AlzadaalUnderseaRuins pos=208.05,-1.5,20.05 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1
quest AhtUrhgan.DivineInterference accepted
charvar Quest[6][75]Prog 4
keyitem WhisperOfRadiance
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass accepted
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus completed
bob: charvar Quest[6][75]Prog 1
bob: keyitem SanDoriaTrustPermit
bob: mission Toau TheEmpressCrowned completed
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus completed
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.DivineInterference completed
carl: keyitem SanDoriaTrustPermit
carl: mission Toau TheEmpressCrowned completed
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.DivineInterference accepted
dan: charvar Quest[6][75]Prog 2
dan: keyitem LightningCell
dan: mission Toau NashmeirasPlea current
login
fill-inventory
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 932
finish option=1                         # a full bag: the state kept
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 932 again (an Event would rotate to 5001)
finish option=1
bob: login
bob: mission Toau EternalMercenary current   # a GM
bob: trigger Imperial_Whitegate         # 931 ties 5092: the first container's
bob: finish option=1
bob: trigger Imperial_Whitegate         # rotated: the other
bob: finish option=1
carl: login
carl: trigger Imperial_Whitegate        # the repeat's 931 ties 5092
carl: finish option=1
dan: login
dan: npcstatus blank_lamp normal        # a GM: shown
dan: trigger blank_lamp                 # 8 and 308 tie: the mission's first
dan: finish option=1
dan: trigger blank_lamp                 # rotated: 308
dan: finish
